{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight a succubus, a seductress who will unleash sexual attacks on you. Fight back with nothing but degenerate moves, including head pats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277560/extras/11.png?t=1743763288\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want a more difficult fight or an easier one? You have the option to choose the difficulty level for each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277560/extras/22.png?t=1743763288\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each turn, your succubus opponent will carry out a sexual attack on you; to win, you must fight and beat the demon by using the unholy trinity of headpat, handhold, and kissing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277560/extras/33.png?t=1743763288\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perhaps you need a little additional assistance before the battle? Interact with the succubus girl and gain a buff that will greatly help you during the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277560/extras/44.png?t=1743763288\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a victory, you will be granted a score, which is needed for content and unlocking progression; the more you win, the more sexual scenes you can see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Age of Consent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3277560/a9e449a91662a6d2e6486320c9d0b0265bd2d070.jpg"},{"name":"Too Young","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3277560/a9e44